The AdvFS file system does not look like any other file system's 
on-disk format.

I do not know of anyone that has ported AdvFS to another OS.

Martin's suggestion about free Alpha emulators and installing 
Tru64 UNIX is your best bet.  Or find someone that has Tru64 UNIX 
up and running and get them to mount your AdvFS file system so you 
can copy your data.


